":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSougnou tégué sougnou bakane thi men mbir, dougnou beuga takhaloo ak mom, tegue thi sougnou khol dou nékh sougnou gnakeu dara wala sougnou meunoul ame li gnou beugue.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1206,"row":{"en":"I encourage everyone to consider donating blood if they are eligible.","wo":"Maa ngi ñaax ku nekk mu dem maye deret su ko mënee.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMangui gnakh kou nek mou dem mayé deret souko meuneé.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1207,"row":{"en":"He couldn't wait to try one!","wo":"Mënul woon ñàkka ñam benn!","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMeunoul wone gnaka niam bene !\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1208,"row":{"en":"In the beginning, there was only darkness.","wo":"Bi mbir yi di tàmbali, lëndëm kesee amoon.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBi mbir yi di tambali, lendeum kesse amone.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1209,"row":{"en":"Don't let these conditions control your life.","wo":"Bul nangu mukk feebar dila moom.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBoul nangou mouk febar dila mom.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1210,"row":{"en":"Finally, the marlin begins to tire.","wo":"Jën wi daal di mujjee tàmbali sonn.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDjeun wi daal di moudjé tambali sonn.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1211,"row":{"en":"That can make for a richer and more fulfilling life.","wo":"Loolu mën nala may dundu gu gëna neex, gëna sotti.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nLolou meun nala may doundou gou geuna nekh, geuna sotti.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1212,"row":{"en":"The cooling capacity is measured in British thermal units (BTUs) per hour.","wo":"Kàttanu seddal gi ñu ngi koy natt ci British thermal units (BTUs) waxtu wu nekk.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nKattaneu sedal gui gnou ngui koy natt thi British thermal units (BTUs) wakhtou wou nek.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1213,"row":{"en":"It’s impossible to resist that dirty, skinny, precious four-legged shadow who peers at you from beneath the bushes.","wo":"Dina jafe lool nga baña faale wooteg boroom ñeenti tànk yu sew yi te tilim, nekk ci suufu ñax yi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDina diafé loool nga bagna falé woté boroom gnenti tank you sew yi té tilime, nek si soufou niakh yi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1214,"row":{"en":"From 10 feet away you could tell the bottom of the boat was in rough shape;","wo":"Soo dandee bato bi ci ñatti meetar (10 feet) dangay gis ni suuf gi daa yàqu;","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSo danndé bateau bi si gniati métres (10 feet) dangay guiss ni souf gui da yakh\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1215,"row":{"en":"He took his time with her, exploring her body with a tenderness that made her melt.","wo":"Su nekkee ak Aida du yàkkamti dara, dina fexe ba yee fépp fu doon nelaw ci yaramam.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSou néké ak Aida dou yakamti dara dina fékhé ba yé fépp fou done nelaw thi yaramam.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1216,"row":{"en":"Raman named the dog Buddy, and they quickly became best friends.","wo":"Roman daal di tuddee xaj bi Buddy, ñu daal di xaritoo ci saa si.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nRoman daldi tuddé khadj bi Buddy, gnou daldi kharito si saa si.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1217,"row":{"en":"Rum is a distilled spirit made from sugarcane molasses or sugarcane juice.","wo":"Rhum bi alkol distiye la buñu defaree melaasu ñàmbi suukër wala ndoxu ñàmbi suukër.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nRhum bi alcool distillé la bouniou defaré mélassou gnambi soukeur wala ndokhou gnambi soukeur.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1218,"row":{"en":"Print the page that contains students' final questions and answers.","wo":"Imprimeel xët wi ndongo yi def seen tontu yu mujj ak seeni laaj.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nImprimél khet wi ndongo yi def seen tontou you moudj ak seeni ladj.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1219,"row":{"en":"The object of the game is to score goals by shooting the puck into the opponent's net.","wo":"Linga wara def ci match bi mooy dugal puck bi ci caaxi beneen ekip bi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nLi nga wara def thi match bi moy dougal puck bi thi caaxi beneen ekip bi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1220,"row":{"en":"do you love me","wo":"ndax bëgg nga ma","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nndakh beug nga ma?\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1221,"row":{"en":"Thank you so much for all your help and for being so dedicated, helpful, cheerful, and energetic.","wo":"Noo ngi leen di sant bu baax ci seen ndimbal ak seen taxawaay, seen xumbaay ak seen cawarte.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nNongi len di sant bou bakh si sen ndimbal ak sen takhaway, sen khoumbay ak sen thiawarté.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1222,"row":{"en":"There are many reasons why we should conserve water.","wo":"Barina lu mëna tax ñu wara baña yàq ndox.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBarina lou meuna takh gnou wara bagna yak ndokh.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1223,"row":{"en":"It's like his body is just used to it.","wo":"Daa melni yaramam dakoo tàmm.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDaa melni yaramam dakoo tamm rek.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1224,"row":{"en":"Interviewer: What drew you to acting and furniture design?","wo":"Laajtekat bi: Lan moo la dugal ci nga nekk aktris ak di defar fotëy?","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nLaajekat bi: lane mo la dougal si nga nek actrice ak di defar photo yi?\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1225,"row":{"en":"These threats are a serious concern, and they need to be addressed.","wo":"Fitna yooyu jaaxal na 