njariñ sunu ekip.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nPatron bi: Sa kham kham ak diar diar yem nama. Yakar nani dinga amal ndiarign sounou ekip.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1232,"row":{"en":"Autoimmune diseases are caused by the body’s immune system attacking its own tissues.","wo":"Liy waral feebar yuy imunise seen bopp ñooy li sistem imuniteeru yaram wi di songee ay tisu boppam.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nLi waral fébar youy imunisé sen bopp gnoy li sistèm imunitérou yaram wi di songué ay tissu boppam.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1233,"row":{"en":"She had won the gold medal, and she had made her country proud.","wo":"Ndaw si gàddu na medaayu wurus bi, siggil na waa réewam.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nNdaaw si gadou na medaayou wourouss bi siggil na wa rewam.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1234,"row":{"en":"My hovercraft is full of eels","wo":"Sama gaalu masin buy naaw dafa fees ak jaanu géej","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSama galou masin bouy naaw dafa fess ak djanou guedj\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1235,"row":{"en":"The first step is to gather your supplies.","wo":"Li njëkk mooy nga dajale say jumtukaay.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nLi nieuk moy nga dadialé say jumtoukay.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1236,"row":{"en":"Rainstorms are a common occurrence in many parts of the world, and they can have a significant impact on our lives.","wo":"Taw yu ànd ak ngelaw barina luñuy am ci gox yu bari ci àdduna bi, te mën nañu am njeexital yu am solo ci sunu dundu.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nTaw you and ak ngelaw barina lougnouy ame thi gox you bari thi addouna bi té meun nagnou ame ndiekhital you ame solo thi souniou doundou.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1237,"row":{"en":"Road rage is never worth it.","wo":"Jàppante ci tali bi amul benn njariñ.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDiappanté thi tali bi amoul ben ndiarign.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1238,"row":{"en":"Chilembwe was a Malawian Baptist minister who led an uprising against British colonial rule in 1915.","wo":"Chilembwe doomu Malawi la, nekkoon pastër baptist bi jiite woon fippug waa réew mi ngir xeex kolonisasioŋ britanik ci 1915.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nChilembwe domou malawi la nekone pasteur baptiste bi djité wone fipou wa rew mi nguir khekh colonisation britannique ci 1915.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1239,"row":{"en":"Like many young artists, Smith worked as a gallery installer and exhibition designer.","wo":"Smith ni moroomi artistam yu bari, dafay defar galëri di nas ak xew-xewu fësal art.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSmith ni moromi artistam you bari dafay defar galerie di nass ak hew-hewou fessal art bi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1240,"row":{"en":"But where did these illnesses come from?","wo":"Waaye fan la feebar yooyu bawoo?","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nWayé fane la fébar yoyou bawo?\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1241,"row":{"en":"In rare cases, a serious condition called compartment syndrome can occur.","wo":"Néew na li ñuy woowe anamu syndrome compartiment bu tar di am.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nNéw na li gnouy wowé anamou syndrome compartiment bou tar di ame.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1242,"row":{"en":"It allows me to work by following my vibes and molding my teaching style to the learning style of the audience.","wo":"Daf ma may ma mëna liggéey ci topp samay yëg-yëg na noppi méngale sama njàngale ak ni say way teewlu di jàngee.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDafma may ma meuna ligueye si top samay yeug yeug na nopi mengalé sama ndjangalé ak ni say way téwlou di dianguee.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1243,"row":{"en":"And the more I liked her.","wo":"Teg ci ma koy gëna bëgg.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nTeug si ma koy geuna beugg.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1244,"row":{"en":"Tiny and tight work—like mine below—can be hard to do, though, so try it with something looser the first time.","wo":"Liggey bu ndaw te jaffe - melni sama bos bi ci suuf - mënna jafe def mu jeex, kon jeemal tàmbalee lu gena yomb.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nLiggey bou ndaw té diaffé - melni sama boss bi thi souf - meuna diaffé def mou diekh, kon dieumal tambalé lou geuna yombe.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1245,"row":{"en":"It's a big question, and one that scientists have been trying to answer for centuries.","wo":"Laaj bu am solo la, te boroom xam-xam yu bari yàgg nañu ci jéem tontu.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nLadje bou am solo la té borom kham kham you bari yague nagnou thiey diém tontou\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1246,"row":{"en":"This makes it a very attractive option for criminals who are looking to make a quick buck.","wo":"Loolu moo ci dugal defkati ñaawtéef yi nga xamni xaalis bu gaaw lañu bëgg.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nLoolou mo thi dougal defkat yi niawtef yi nga khamni khalis bou gaaw lagnou beug rek.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1247,"row":{"en":"The history of Burkina Faso is long and complex, but one of the most important events in the country's history was the 1983 coup d'état that brought Thomas Sankara to power.","wo":"Taarixu réewum Burkina Foso yaatu na te barina ay jaar-jaar, waaye benn ci yi ci gëna am solo mooy jaar-jaaru réew mi ci coup detaa bu 1983 bi Thomas Sankara jëlee réew mi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nTaarikhou réewoum Burkina Fasso yaatou na te barina ay jaar jaar wayé bene ci yii ci geuna am solo moy jaar jaaru réew mi ci coup d'état bou 1983 bii Thomas Sankara dieulé réew mi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1248,"row":{"en":"In its broadest sense, science encompasses all human knowledge and activity motivated by a desire to understand the natural world and its phenomena.","wo":"Ci anam wu gëna yaatu, science dafay laal lépp luy xam-xamu nit ak bépp liggéey boo xamni li ko taxa jog mooy xam ni àdduna bi di doxee ak mbir yi ciy xew.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nCi anam wou geuna yaatou, science dafay laal leup louy kham khamou nitt ak beup liguey boo khamni liko takha diog moy kham ni aduna bi di dokhé ak mbir yi ciy heuwé.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1249,"row":{"en":"I don't understand what you mean","wo":"Xamuma lan nga bëgg a wax","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nKhamouma lane nga beugue wakh\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1250,"row":{"en":"After work, people might relax at home with their families, go out to dinner, or attend a cultural event.","wo":"Ku liggéey ba wàcci ñibbi sa kër noppalu wala nga nekk ak sa njaboot, génn reer, wala dem ci xew-xewu aada.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nKou liguey ba wathi gnibi sa keur noppalou wala nga nekk ak sa ndiabote guenn reer wala dem si hew-hewou aada.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1251,"row":{"en":"In 2001, Chris joined the family business, where he served as a sales representative for five years.","wo":"Ci 2001, Chris dugg na ci liggéeyu famiy bi, mu nekkoon fa jaaykat ci diiru juróomi at.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nCi 2001, Chris dougg na si ligueyou famille bi, mou nekone fa diaykat si diirou diouromi at.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1252,"row":{"en":"In addition to their companionship, horses can also be used for a variety of purposes.","wo":"Lu weesu liñu lay wéttali, am nañu yeneen mbir yuñ la mëna jàppalee.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nLou wessou lignou lay wétali, am nagnou yénéne mbir yougnou la meuna diapalé.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1253,"row":{"en":"There's this engineer at my school who subsists off coffee.","wo":"Sama ekol moo am waa joo xam ni kafe rek lay dugal ci biiram.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSama école mo am wa djoo khamni café rek lay dougal si biram.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1254,"row":{"en":"It takes a lot of energy to treat and transport water, and it is important to use water wisely so that we do not waste this precious resource.","wo":"Ngir defar ndox bamu baax ak yóbbu ko famu wara dem doon na liggéey bu metti, kon ku nekk daa wara sakkanal ndox te moytu koo yàq ndax daa am njariñ.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nNgir defar ndokh bamou bakh ak yobou ko famou wara dem done na liguey bou metti kone kou nek da wara sakkanal ndokh té moytou koo yakh ndakh da am ndiarigne.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1255,"row":{"en":"They should look for those things that inspire dedication, loyalty, honor and dignity.","wo":"War nañu wut mbir yu rafet yu melni njub, dëggu ak ngor.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nWar nagnou wout mbir you rafet you melni ndioub, deugu ak ngor.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1256,"row":{"en":"It is a time of hope and renewal, and I always feel invigorated by it.","wo":"Jamonoy yaakaar ak yeeslu la, saa yu nekk daf may dundal.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nJamono yaakar ak yésslou la sa you nek dafmay doundal.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1257,"row":{"en":"It had seen many years of service, carrying its owners on voyages to far-off lands.","wo":"Liggéey na ay at yu bari, yóbbu ñi ko moomoon ñu tukki ci dëkk yu sori.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nLiggey na ay att you bari, yobou gni ko momone gnou touki si deuk you sori.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1258,"row":{"en":"I'm so tempted to go B: You should do it.","wo":"Sama xel mi yépp a ngi ci B: Kon war nga ci dem.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSama hel mi yeup a ngui thi B: Kon war nga thie dem.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1259,"row":{"en":"Some of these unkind words include retarded, idiot, stupid and dumb.","wo":"Yenn ci kàddu yu ñaaw yooyu ñooy wayadi, dof, ñàkk xel ak néew xam-xam.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nYen thi kadou you niaw yoyou gnoy wayadi dof niakhel ak new khamkham\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1260,"row":{"en":"Of course, it's not always easy to do the right thing.","wo":"Dëgg la, def liy yoon du saa yu nekk lay yomb.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDeug la def liy yoon dou sa you nek lay yombe.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1261,"row":{"en":"But faster economic activity could also translate into some degree of inflation.","wo":"Waaye yenn liggéey yu gaaw ci wàllu koom-koom mën na xawa jur inflation.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nWayé yenn liguey you gaaw si wallou kom kom meun na khawa diour inflation.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1262,"row":{"en":"I studied hard for weeks, and I was confident that I would pass.","wo":"Jàngoon naa ay ayi-bis, ma wóolu sama bopp gëmoon ni damay jàll.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDiangone na ay ayi-biss, ma wolou sama bopp geumon ni damay djalé.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1263,"row":{"en":"Finally, my turn came, and I presented my portfolio to the woman at the counter.","wo":"Mujjee naa yegg, ma daal di jox sama portfëy jigéen ji nekkoon ci kontuwaar bi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMoudié na yegue, ma daldi diokh sama portefeuil djiguéne dji nékone thi kontouwar bi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1264,"row":{"en":"Josephine has never felt this way about anyone before.","wo":"Josephine musul miinee nii keneen kudul moom.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nJosephine meussoul miné ni kénéne koudoul mom.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1265,"row":{"en":"This chapter is largely a tutorial on handling experimental errors of measurement.","wo":"Chapitre dafay jàngale bu bari ni ñuy saafara 