_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1271,"row":{"en":"Person 1: Romantic Comedies are so unrealistic.","wo":"Nit 1: Komedi romàntik dañu wuute lool ak dëgg.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nNit 1: Comédie romantik daniou wouté loool ak deug.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1272,"row":{"en":"My colleague was a hard worker, but she was always getting passed over for promotions.","wo":"Sama naataango bi ku ñeme coono la, waaye ak li muy daj lépp du tax mu awaase.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSama naatango bi kou niémé thiono la wayé ak li mouy dadj lép dou takh mou awaasé.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1273,"row":{"en":"obsession","wo":"bëggeel gu jéggi dayoo","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nbeugeul gou djégui dayoo\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1274,"row":{"en":"Christians believe that Jesus is the Son of God and that he came to earth to save people from their sins.","wo":"Chretien dañu gëm ni Jesus mooy Doomu Yàlla, te daa wàcci ci kaw suuf ngir muccal nit ñi ci seeni bàkkaar.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nChrétien daniou geum ni djésus moy domou yalla té da wathie si kaw souf nguir mouthial nitt gni si seni bakhar.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1275,"row":{"en":"Once you have made your list, take some time to reflect on each item and how it has made your life better.","wo":"Soo defaree sa lim ba noppi, nanga ci xalaat ci bu nekk ci ñoom ak njariñ li ñu indi ci sa dundu.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSo défaré sa lim ba noppi nanga thi khalaate thi bou neuk thi gnom ak ndiarign li gnou indi thi sa doundou\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1276,"row":{"en":"The dual-energy technique simplifies bone and plaque removal.","wo":"Pexem ñaari energie dafay yombal dindig yag ak plaak.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nPekhem gnaari énergie dafay yombal dindigue yague ak plake.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1277,"row":{"en":"His parents, who had been driving by when the accident happened, rushed to his side.","wo":"Waajuram yi doon romb ak seen oto bi aksidaa bi di am, daw ñëw ci wetam.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nWaadiouram yi done romb ak seen auto bi accident bi di ame daw nieuw si wetam.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1278,"row":{"en":"If you're new to vegetarian cooking, there are a number of resources available to help you get started.","wo":"Sudee dangay jàng togg nugget, barina mbir yu am ci marse bi yoo mëna tàmbalee.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSudé dangay diangue togue nugget barina mbir you ame thi marché bi yo meuna tambalé\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1279,"row":{"en":"Cousin 2: You're right, Aunty.","wo":"Cousin 2: Wax nga dëgg tànta.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nCousin 2: wakh nga deug tanta\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1280,"row":{"en":"But if you find yourself wearing shabby clothes all the time, it's time to take a look at yourself.","wo":"Waaye sudee fuñu la fekk yaa ngi sol yéere yu ëpp, jotna nga xoolaat sa bopp.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nWayé soudé fougnou la fekk ya ngi sol yéré you eup diotna nga kholat sa boppé\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1281,"row":{"en":"What are you eating on a typical day?","wo":"Lan ngay faral di lekk bis bu nekk?","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nLane ngay faral di lekk biss bou nekk ?\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1282,"row":{"en":"What happens to a presumed thief, carrying a wallet that does not belong to him, who is held by the police?","wo":"Lan mooy dall kiñu njort ni sacc la, mu yoron ab kalpe bumu moomul, te polis japponko?","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nLane moy dall kignou gnort ni sathie la, mou yorone ab kalpé boumou momoul té police diaponeko ?\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1283,"row":{"en":"The baker cut a slice of bread and took a bite.","wo":"Lakk-kat b